        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      },
      "text": "This route brings together four very different sides of Argentina. In Buenos Aires, explore historic neighbourhoods and broad avenues and spend an evening at a tango show. In Mendoza, the focus shifts to vineyards, wineries and the Andes on the horizon. Then travel south to El Calafate and the Perito Moreno Glacier. The trip ends in a very different climate, amid the tropical forest and waterfalls of Iguazú."
